#: ../../source/docs/common-greensightultrablue.rst:360
#: 1acacb6f54194c74a64fa16f61cb5807 4dadebea639f4fddb06b9482915b14c8
#: 90962e0ad86b4944a37f88351df4ec0a c7a7a2110efa4b919146a5c96a261904
#: dc928cedf1224ed1bcd32a13b4d5fecf
msgid ""
"JP10 is a capacitively coupled ethernet port due to space constraints. It "
"officially supports 10/100 communication over 4x of the pins, MDI pairs 0 "
"and 1, which would correspond to pins 1, 2, 3, and 6 on a standard RJ-45 end"
" (Orange and Green ethernet cable/RJ-45 pairs). Even though these pairs are "
"capacitively coupled, full Gigabit capability has been tested and verified "
"in the lab with all 8x pins in use; the caveat is that this test was done "
"with a cable ~1m long. Speeds above 10/100 may be unstable with longer cable"
" lengths and are not guaranteed. Dual 10/100 connections may also be "
"possible, though this is entirely dependent on the capabilities of the "
"Jetson module itself."
msgstr ""
"由于空间限制，JP10 是一个电容耦合的以太网端口。它官方支持通过其中 4 根引脚（MDI 线对 0 和 1）进行 10/100 通信，对应标准 "
"RJ-45 接头上的 1、2、3、6 号引脚（以太网线/RJ-45 的橙色和绿色线对）。尽管这些线对采用电容耦合，实验室中已使用全部 8 "
"根引脚测试并验证了完整的千兆能力；需要注意的是，该测试使用的线缆长约 1m。使用更长的线缆时，高于 10/100 的速率可能不稳定，且不作保证。双路 "
"10/100 连接也可能可行，但这完全取决于 Jetson 模块本身的能力。"

